GOVER-022	GOVERNANCE	Some regulators request native-language executive summaries for board files.	TC1. The tester confirms the language requirement with the engagement sponsor — English-only by default, or English + Arabic executive summary for board-level distribution — and books a translation slot with an NDA-cleared translation provider where bilingual is required. Translation timeline is added to the project plan so it does not delay regulator submission. Evidence: language decision memo, translator NDA reference, project-plan task with start / finish dates.
